                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Carpenter to Mr.
                            Bartleman.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
